exec ( $cmd,  $params = null
,  $silent = false
,  $wait = true
)

Executes a system command.





Parameters










string$cmd

The command to execute. 




string | array$params

The parameters to pass to the command. Can be a pre-formed string (for backwards compatibility) or array of individual arguments (recommended for automatic quoting). 




bool$silent

Whether to execute the command silently. 




bool$wait

Whether to wait for the process to exit.







                Returns


mixed The result of the command execution. 




